  "title": "Barbie&#39;s Blueberry Zucchini Bread with Oatmeal and Walnuts",
  "description": "A slice of this zucchini oatmeal bread studded with fresh blueberries, coconut, and walnuts makes a super moist and delicious treat.",
  "authors": [
